# Strings
#
# Concatenation xy builds strings (x y when items are words). GEB's formal
# systems (pq, tq, dnd) are strings of hyphens: --- stands for 3, so adding is
# concatenating. Bar tallies with arithmetic are in tally.btp.

## Concatenation, and sequences written with a space between items
rTmMk  : xy
rTmSeq : x y

## Hyphen tallies (GEB)
rTm- : -
tm-!    : rTm-
tm--!   : rTmMk x=tm-!;y=tm-!
tm---!  : rTmMk x=tm--!;y=tm-!
tm----! : rTmMk x=tm--!;y=tm--!
